~ t1 #[总是 zong3zhi4]
~ t2 #[老是 lao3shi4]
~ mod1 #[这么 zhe4me]
~ mod2 #[那么 na4me]
~ mod3 #[很 hen3]
~ mod4 #[特别 te4bie2]

structure subject + $t1 + v.
main-trl to always do something

examples

example #1[他 tā] #2[$t1] #3[一个人 yi2 ge ren2] #6[吃饭 chīfàn] 。
trl *1[He] *2[always] *4[eats] *3[alone].

example #1[我的 wǒ de] #2[学生 xuéshēng] #3[$t1] #4[有 yǒu] #5[很多 hěnduō] #6[有意思 yǒuyìsi] #[的 de] #7[问题 wèntí] 。
trl *1[My] *2[students] *3[always] *4[have] *5[a lot of] *6[interesting] *7[questions].

example #1[不要 bùyào] #2[$t2] #3[笑话 xiàohuà] #4[别人 biérén] 。
trl *1[Don't] *3[laugh at] *4[other people] *2[all the time].

end examples

p To use $t1 or t2 with an adj., a modifier such as $mod1, $mod2, $mod3 or $mod4 has to be inserted in between.

examples

example #1[别 bié] #2[$t1] #3[不高兴 bù gāoxìng] 。
trl *1[Don't] *2[always] *4[be unhappy].

example #1[你 nǐ] #2[为什么 wèishéme] #3[$t1] #4[$mod1] #5[忙 máng] ？
trl *2[Why] *5[are] *1[you] *3[always] *4[so] *5[busy]?

example #1[你 nǐ] #2[$t1] #3[$mod1] #4[晚 wǎn] #5[回家 huí jiā] 。
trl *1[You] *2[always] *5[come home] *3[so] *4[late].

example #1[你 nǐ] #2[怎么 zěnme] #3[$t2] #4[$mod1] #5[高兴 gāoxìng] ？
trl *2[How] *5[are] *1[you] *3[always] *4[so] *5[happy]?

end examples